{"reviews":[{"id":"B012V77VHE-0","r":2.0,"t":"Missing Pieces/ not as advertised","x":"Received my product today. Short of s few cuffs I am very disappointed. Can't advertise 12pc and only send 10. What happened to quality control?","h":7,"v":1,"d":"Aug 2017"},{"id":"B012V77VHE-1","r":1.0,"t":"A waste of money","x":"Even though these were inexpensive, I still feel like I totally wasted money. Decided to pick these up to compliment my daughters braids, but only 4 of them were even remotely usable. The remainder were either flat as a pancake or so bent out of shape they were useless. Very disappointed. Wouldn\u2019t recommend","h":4,"v":1,"d":"Nov 2017"},{"id":"B012V77VHE-2","r":3.0,"t":"Easily Breakable","x":"Hello I used these cuffs on a lock style and I was disappointed in the quality. The metal was quite flimsy and broke very easily. Be very gentle and do not bend to hard or they will snap!","h":3,"v":1,"d":"Feb 2021"},{"id":"B012V77VHE-3","r":3.0,"t":"Easily Breakable","x":"Hello I used these cuffs on a lock style and I was disappointed in the quality. The metal was quite flimsy and broke very easily. Be very gentle and do not bend to hard or they will snap!","h":3,"v":1,"d":"Feb 2021"},{"id":"B012V77VHE-4","r":1.0,"t":"BUYER BEWARE","x":"If I could do a 0 stars I would! The prouduct was not sealed!!! The product was also half empty!!! Do not purchase! Total waste of money!","h":3,"v":1,"d":"Feb 2017"},{"id":"B012V77VHE-5","r":1.0,"t":"BUYER BEWARE","x":"If I could do a 0 stars I would! The prouduct was not sealed!!! The product was also half empty!!! Do not purchase! Total waste of money!","h":3,"v":1,"d":"Feb 2017"},{"id":"B012V77VHE-6","r":4.0,"t":"Happy with it","x":"Happy with it, but there aren't that many in the bag-- only 15 or so.  but very pretty and nice quality.","h":3,"v":1,"d":"Oct 2015"},{"id":"B012V77VHE-7","r":5.0,"t":"Used for cosplay!","x":"These were a great little addition to my cosplay!","h":3,"v":1,"d":"Jun 2018"},{"id":"B012V77VHE-8","r":1.0,"t":"Cheaply Made Save Money","x":"Bought these for my summer hair wraps . The color was way off I thought it would be the yellowish gold as pictured . Their Also very stretchy could break at any moment while installing. Not worth the money . Highly upset these took awhile to get to me I ordered them May 25th it\u2019s now June 9th. Highly dissatisfied .","h":2,"v":1,"d":"Jun 2020"},{"id":"B012V77VHE-9","r":3.0,"t":"Smashed Cuffs","x":"Every single cuff was smashed and had to be reshaped as best as I could. A couple remained distorted even after I made my best attempts at fixing them. Product needs to be shipped in better packaging to avoid smashing. A customer should not have to reshape cuffs before wearing them.","h":2,"v":1,"d":"Dec 2020"},{"id":"B012V77VHE-10","r":4.0,"t":"Cute, Cheap, and Complimentary","x":"These are cute, cheap and they compliment my dreadlocks. They are malleable and easy to use. However, I would advise that you be gentle handling the jewelry because they are quite thin and I can see them losing their shape with rough handling.","h":2,"v":1,"d":"Nov 2017"},{"id":"B012V77VHE-11","r":1.0,"t":"Only recieved 3!","x":"This would've been a good product, but I only received 3 of the gold caps in my box. There was no bag or anything, only 3 of the gold hair pieces. There should be been more. I would like them replaced or refunded.","h":2,"v":1,"d":"Apr 2018"},{"id":"B012V77VHE-12","r":3.0,"t":"false advertising","x":"I bought them for a one time event and they served their purpose, but they're so flimsy! They're meant to be flexible, but these are just on another level. Also, there's only 10 in the packet","h":2,"v":1,"d":"Jul 2018"},{"id":"B012V77VHE-13","r":1.0,"t":"Awful","x":"This was an awful product. The color is terrible, very orange not gold. The product is so cheap, much nicer alternatives at my local beauty supply.","h":2,"v":1,"d":"Apr 2021"},{"id":"B012V77VHE-14","r":3.0,"t":"You can definitely only use these once. So be ...","x":"You can definitely only use these once. So be aware when you buy them that once you take them off the braid they are done.","h":2,"v":1,"d":"Dec 2017"},{"id":"B012V77VHE-15","r":3.0,"t":"A couple of these were completely bent flat. Not ...","x":"A couple of these were completely bent flat. Not many in the pack, so it mattered more than it normally would have.","h":2,"v":1,"d":"Jan 2016"},{"id":"B012V77VHE-16","r":1.0,"t":"Not worth more than $0.20","x":"They are not worth the price on Amazon or elsewhere unless it's for $0.10-$0.20 due to the fact they turn color after a day or two and they break easily. I bought a pack from my local beauty supplies store for $1.99 and I put them in my daughter's hair after braiding.  Two of them broke within two days and the rest turned silver. They were cute when I first purchased them though.","h":1,"v":0,"d":"Feb 2016"},{"id":"B012V77VHE-17","r":5.0,"t":"These look sexy","x":"My wife wears braids or twists and puts these on the thick strands and it looks really nice. Nice bright gold color, they really stand out and don't look cheap. Can also wear them at the top of your ear to look a little edgy. If they get bent out of shape, just put them around a pen or something else cylindrical and smooth it out back into a circular/cylindrical shape.","h":1,"v":1,"d":"Apr 2020"},{"id":"B012V77VHE-18","r":3.0,"t":"Basic Dreadlock Cuffs","x":"I ordered 2 packs of cuffs and each were mailed separately. One of the cuffs were bent in the first set so I had to toss it. The color is also more of an orange gold to me than yellow gold. Design is as pictured but the quality seems the same as with any other dreadlock cuffs based on what I've read from other reviews.","h":1,"v":1,"d":"Aug 2020"},{"id":"B012V77VHE-19","r":1.0,"t":"Disappointed","x":"These were like the cheapest material ever. Probably made from aluminum. I ordered the gold. The color is not very attractive and neither is the design. And the beads were WAY smaller than I expected. Not worth the effort to return them, but I probably won't use them either. Bummer.","h":1,"v":1,"d":"Apr 2021"},{"id":"B012V77VHE-20","r":1.0,"t":"They are not worth your money","x":"The picture showed more than 12 pieces so I obviously just saw the price and assumed there would be more. The quality and quantity are not worth it for this price. There are literally other sellers offering up to 120 pieces for only 2 dollars more. Do not play yourself","h":1,"v":1,"d":"Apr 2019"},{"id":"B012V77VHE-21","r":5.0,"t":"So cute!","x":"Loved these ! They are like mini cuffs that bend and you can put them in your hair. I bent them over thick enough sections of my hair that none of them fell out the whole night. They looked great I loved them! Great buy and will buy more I love how they look \ud83d\ude0d","h":1,"v":1,"d":"Nov 2020"},{"id":"B012V77VHE-22","r":2.0,"t":"For a doll or little kids hair!","x":"This product is a lot smaller than I expected.  It also has more of an orangish tint than gold.  Not really interested in using them anymore.  I'll probably give them to someone who doesn't care about the size or tint.","h":1,"v":1,"d":"Oct 2018"},{"id":"B012V77VHE-23","r":2.0,"t":"Poor quality","x":"These are the worst braid cuffs I\u2019ve ever bought. They look pretty but are so flimsy and break easily. They don\u2019t hold a braid very well and keep coming off. Spend a few more bucks and buy some for much better quality","h":1,"v":1,"d":"Feb 2019"},{"id":"B012V77VHE-24","r":3.0,"t":"You get what you pay for!","x":"I mean, you get what you pay for! The price is right but the product definitely falls out and bends out of shape really easily. I'd recommend getting a couple or spending more on ones that don't fall out as easily.","h":1,"v":1,"d":"Aug 2017"}],"emb":"","summary":{"claims":[{"text":"Many reviewers report receiving fewer pieces than advertised or expected, with some packages half empty or missing items entirely.","cites":[1,5,6,7,12,13]},{"text":"Reviewers frequently describe the cuffs as flimsy, thin, easily bent out of shape, or prone to breaking.","cites":[2,3,4,9,10,11,13]},{"text":"Several customers complain about the color being off, describing it as orange rather than the gold pictured.","cites":[9,14]},{"text":"Some reviewers find the cuffs cute, pretty, and a nice addition for cosplay or dreadlocks.","cites":[7,8,11]},{"text":"A few reviewers note the cuffs are single-use or lose their shape after removal.","cites":[11,15]}]},"qa":[]}